        {
          "type": "wobble",
          "offset": "3870"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Thanks for buying this Story Vote Ticket!",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3877"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "The writers of Surviving High School are working on a brand new series to be sold in Surviving High School's On Demand store...",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3884"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "And for the first time ever, we're letting `YOU` decide what we write!",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3891",
          "text_bbcode": "And for the first time ever, we're letting [b]YOU[/b] decide what we write!"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Play through the four sneak peeks that follow this message and then cast your vote for the genre you want to play!",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3901"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Remember, the two genres with the fewest votes `will be eliminated...`",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3911",
          "text_bbcode": "Remember, the two genres with the fewest votes [b]will be eliminated...[/b]"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "After that, we'll put the two remaining genres head-to-head for a `final showdown!`",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3921",
          "text_bbcode": "After that, we'll put the two remaining genres head-to-head for a [b]final showdown![/b]"
        },
        {
