        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "`GENRE #1: VAMPIRES!`",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3966",
          "text_bbcode": "[b]GENRE #1: VAMPIRES![/b]"
        },
        {
          "type": "background",
          "style": "custom",
          "asset_id": "26001",
          "variant": "-1",
          "character_id": "-1",
          "expression": "-1",
          "via": "35",
          "offset": "3978"
        },
        {
          "type": "pov_change",
          "character": "Kara",
          "index": "0",
          "offset": "3982"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Do you want to experience the supernatural as an alluring and mysterious `vampire?`",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "3992",
          "text_bbcode": "Do you want to experience the supernatural as an alluring and mysterious [b]vampire?[/b]"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Kara",
          "emotion_code": "3",
          "image": "26017",
          "text": "Whoa... My head, it's swimming, and everything feels so... `Vivid...` So alive... Do you always feel like this after you feed?",
          "character_id": "0",
          "expression": "3",
          "offset": "4001",
          "text_bbcode": "Whoa... My head, it's swimming, and everything feels so... [color=#3b78e2][i]Vivid...[/i][/color] So alive... Do you always feel like this after you feed?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Gabriel",
          "emotion_code": "2",
          "image": "26021",
          "text": "After a while, you learn to control yourself, but at first, the taste of blood is intoxicating, overpowering...",
          "character_id": "1",
          "expression": "2",
          "offset": "4010"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Gabriel",
          "emotion_code": "3",
          "image": "26022",
          "text": "If you're not careful, it's easy to lose control.",
          "character_id": "1",
          "expression": "3",
          "offset": "4019"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Gabriel",
          "emotion_code": "3",
          "image": "26022",
          "text": "And that could make you a target... For hunters, the vaeittir, or worse...",
          "character_id": "1",
          "expression": "3",
          "offset": "4028"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Kara",
          "emotion_code": null,
          "image": "26014",
          "text": "Okay, but Gabriel, what if I `wanted` to lose control...",
          "character_id": "0",
          "offset": "4035",
          "text_bbcode": "Okay, but Gabriel, what if I [color=#3b78e2][i]wanted[/i][/color] to lose control..."
        },
        {
          "type": "set_scene_value",
          "value": "6",
          "offset": "4041"
        },
        {
          "type": "music",
          "action": "stop",
          "fade_ms": "4500",
          "offset": "4047"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Kara",
          "emotion_code": null,
          "image": "26014",
          "text": "What if there was someone I wanted to lose control `with?`",
          "character_id": "0",
