          "offset": "4224"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Do you want to explore the storybook world of `fairy tales` come to life?",
          "character_id": "9",
          "expression": "0",
          "offset": "4234",
          "text_bbcode": "Do you want to explore the storybook world of [b]fairy tales[/b] come to life?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Briar",
          "emotion_code": "1",
          "image": "26035",
          "text": "I've had enough this! Beds with vegetables stuffed under the mattresses! Snooty mirrors that always talk about prettier people...",
          "character_id": "5",
          "expression": "1",
          "offset": "4243"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Briar",
          "emotion_code": "1",
          "image": "26035",
          "text": "Not to mention the glass slippers! What genius came up with footwear that `shatters?` Nobody could possibly be worth all this trouble!",
          "character_id": "5",
          "expression": "1",
          "offset": "4252",
          "text_bbcode": "Not to mention the glass slippers! What genius came up with footwear that [color=#3b78e2][i]shatters?[/i][/color] Nobody could possibly be worth all this trouble!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Siegfried",
          "emotion_code": null,
          "image": "26044",
          "text": "Really? That's not what you said the night the prince kissed you...",
          "character_id": "6",
          "offset": "4261"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Siegfried",
          "emotion_code": null,
          "image": "26044",
          "text": "I seem to recall you mentioning that his eyes were like 'limpid pools of iridescent sea foam'...",
          "character_id": "6",
          "offset": "4270"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Briar",
          "emotion_code": "2",
          "image": "26036",
          "text": "Okay... Okay... I admit. He is really cute... And a `prince...` And if I want to date him, I have to complete the final test...",
          "character_id": "5",
          "expression": "2",
          "offset": "4279",
          "text_bbcode": "Okay... Okay... I admit. He is really cute... And a [color=#3b78e2][i]prince...[/i][/color] And if I want to date him, I have to complete the final test..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Siegfried",
          "emotion_code": "1",
          "image": "26045",
          "text": "Of course, Briar, but you know there are more pressing matters at hand than princely boys...",
          "character_id": "6",
