          "speaker": "Briar",
          "emotion_code": "1",
          "image": "26035",
          "text": "I've had enough this! Beds with vegetables stuffed under the mattresses! Snooty mirrors that always talk about prettier people...",
          "character_id": "5",
          "expression": "1",
          "offset": "4243"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "Briar",
          "emotion_code": "1",
          "image": "26035",
          "text": "Not to mention the glass slippers! What genius came up with footwear that `shatters?` Nobody could possibly be worth all this trouble!",
          "character_id": "5",
          "expression": "1",
          "offset": "4252",
          "text_bbcode": "Not to mention the glass slippers! What genius came up with footwear that [color=#3b78e2][i]shatters?[/i][/color] Nobody could possibly be worth all this trouble!"
